     * {@code "PREMIUM"} when the membership level is 3 or more, otherwise {@code "STANDARD"}. AREA is
     * {@code "METRO"} when the locality is a known region (NSW, VIC or QLD), otherwise
     * {@code "REGIONAL"}.
